FASE 6 — EARLY STOPPING REAL
=============================

Implementar correctamente:

--epochs
--patience
--early-stop-rounds

============================================================
1. SEQUENCE MODELS

Para:

LSTM
CNN
Transformer

usar validation durante entrenamiento.

No utilizar TEST.

============================================================
2. EARLY STOPPING

Ejemplo:

epochs = 50
patience = 5

Epoch 1:
train_loss = ...
val_loss = ...

...

Epoch 12:
val_loss = 0.601

Epoch 13:
val_loss = 0.603

...

Epoch 17:
Early stopping

Best epoch = 12

============================================================
3. CHECKPOINT

Guardar el mejor estado:

best_validation_loss

No guardar simplemente el último epoch.

============================================================
4. TRAIN METRICS

No confundir:

loss

con:

accuracy

Reportar:

train_loss
validation_loss
train_accuracy
validation_accuracy

cuando estén disponibles.

============================================================
5. ÁRBOLES

Para:

XGBoost
LightGBM
CatBoost

implementar eval_set / validation set y early stopping cuando
la API concreta lo permita.

No inventar parámetros incompatibles con la versión instalada.

============================================================
6. OUTPUT

LSTM:

Epoch 01/50 ...
